To remove the ball and chain, simply read a scroll of remove curse.  By the
way, the ball, once removed, makes for a great throwing weapon.  Another
useful thing is that you can get out of tight spots while punished, simply
throw the ball where you want to go, i.e. out of a store after cleaning
house.  A word of warning, don't do this to get out of a bear trap (a pit
trap is ok), it will make travelling difficult.

Don't kill the killer bees!  They make for good eating (only one per
customer, thank you)

